# CloudDBZoneObject

|class info|
|:------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|com.huawei.agconnect.cloud.database.CloudDBZoneObject CloudDBZoneObject类是一个抽象类，属于对象类型的基类，您可以通过添加AppGallery Connect控制台导出的对象类型来实现创建继承此类的对象类型。|

## Public Method Summary

|Return type|Method name|
|:----------|:-------------------------------------------------------|
|String|[getObjectTypeName](#section14101203817218)() 获取对象类型的名称。|
|String|[getPackageName](#section69251511211)() 获取自定义对象类型类的全路径。|

